{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_chapter2", "label": "Chapter 2 \u2014 The protocols", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_channel_construction", "label": "\u00a72.1 Channel construction \u2014 one parent term, one \u2113, one series in n", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_admissibility", "label": "\u00a72.2 Admissibility \u2014 r = 2Z\u00b2R/(\u03bd\u00b3\u03c3) \u2265 5", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Because r falls as \u03bd\u207b\u00b3 every channel eventually leaves the domain, and the rule states where in advance rather than discovering it after the fact."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_cost_resolvability", "label": "\u00a72.3 Cost resolvability \u2014 \u03bd \u2264 \u03bd_V", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The bracket needs levels separated; the cost test needs curvature resolved, and curvature washes out first."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_dilution", "label": "\u00a72.4 Dilution divides; it does not forbid", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_census_before_search", "label": "\u00a72.5 Census before search", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "D comes from the core configuration with no spectroscopic data, so the admissible set is fixed before a single measurement is sought."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_declines_recorded", "label": "\u00a72.6 Declines are recorded", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A collection reporting only successes cannot be checked."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_exhaustive_verification", "label": "\u00a72.7 Exhaustive verification where possible", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sampling can bound how often a thing fails but never prove it never does."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_two_independent_routes", "label": "\u00a72.8 Two independent routes \u2014 \u2145_def made operational", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An identity computed along a single path proves nothing: w = V\u00b7e cannot fail if V was itself defined as w/e."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_test_must_fail", "label": "\u00a72.9 A test must be able to fail", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A pass from a check whose ability to fail was never shown is disclosure dressed as evidence."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_refuse_not_coerce", "label": "\u00a72.10 Refuse rather than coerce \u2014 no third state", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Totality catches the null-read-as-false class by preventing the computation from running rather than detecting the error after it has spread."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_retrieval", "label": "\u00a72.11 Retrieval \u2014 enumerate, list routes, re-enumerate as the target set grows", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Enumerating once is a snapshot, and a snapshot of a growing object is a defect the moment it is taken."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_provenance", "label": "\u00a72.12 Provenance \u2014 every number traces to a compilation, table and page", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_withdrawal", "label": "\u00a72.13 Withdrawal \u2014 every retracted claim logged with what replaced it", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_commit_before_look", "label": "\u00a72.14 Commit before you look", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only protocol adopted in response to an error no computation could have caught: every computation was correct and what failed was the independence of a choice."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_compute_then_write", "label": "\u00a72.15 Compute, then write", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_failure_is_a_bound", "label": "\u00a72.16 Every failure is a bound", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Recorded rather than discarded, failures accumulate into bounds; when the lower and upper bounds meet, the answer lies between them."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_the_grid", "label": "\u00a72.17 The grid \u2014 read the empty cells", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chapter 6 applied to a question rather than to the elements. A reduction does not close a question; state the reduction and the residue in the same sentence."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_triangulation", "label": "\u00a72.18 Triangulation \u2014 three results locate a fourth", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three that locate no consistent fourth give a correction instead, and the protocol does not distinguish the two outcomes in advance."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_renumber_cascade", "label": "The renumber cascade and cut-section dependency map", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reader-volume reduction keeps the rules and moves the worked examples and instrument histories to the working record; every reference into a cut section must be inlined or re-pointed."}], "edges": [{"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_chapter2", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_channel_construction", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_chapter2", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_admissibility", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter2-protocols.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_chapter2", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter2_protocols_cost_resolvability", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapt